    "singlePass": "Detects writer/codec completion errors, file fsync failure and final-length mismatch; latent stored corruption remains discoverable only on a later decode.",
    "frameChecksum": "For this injected bit flip, the checksummed frame failed at codec decode while the unchecked frame decoded and then failed its logical SHA-256. It performs no extra write-time read and is not claimed to improve every corruption diagnosis.",
